          "summary": "Replace the Net Sales-based Termination Payment with a three-month fee cap payable only on termination for convenience.",
          "comment": "[Playbook] Our position is that we should not owe liquidated damages or penalties on termination; as HDI funds the site build and hosting, we can accept a single early-termination fee capped at three months' fees under Section 3.1, payable only if we terminate for convenience. The existing formula (50% of a year's Net Sales above $800,000) is an uncapped penalty far exceeding HDI's revenue share and would even apply where we terminate for HDI's failure to perform.",
