              "paragraphId": "p0026",
              "oldText": "(a) In the event the Company terminates this Agreement, the Company shall pay to HDI a termination payment, (the \"Termination Payment\") the amount of which shall be an amount equal to the aggregate Net Sales for the twelve (12) months preceding the Termination Date less $800,000, the balance of which shall be divided by two.",
              "newText": "(a) In the event the Company terminates this Agreement for convenience upon notice pursuant to Section 4.1, the Company shall pay to HDI a termination payment (the \"Termination Payment\") in an amount equal to the aggregate fees payable by the Company to HDI pursuant to Section 3.1 in respect of the three (3) calendar months immediately preceding the Termination Date, which amount shall be the sole and exclusive amount payable by the Company in connection with such termination. No Termination Payment or other liquidated amount, penalty or damages shall be payable by the Company where the Company terminates this Agreement pursuant to Section 1.6 or as a result of HDI's breach of this Agreement."
